{"4734860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Inner Demons", "steam_appid": 4734860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/c47bdf88fcec8a58773e08dfe3a0be52.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/c47bdf88fcec8a58773e08dfe3a0be52.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/c47bdf88fcec8a58773e08dfe3a0be52.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inner Demons is a first-person psychological horror game that takes you on a dark, surreal descent into your own unravelling mind. The monsters hunting you are physical manifestations of your fears, and nothing around you is guaranteed to be real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror in the vein of Outlast and Resident Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mind you have to find your way through</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section is a path through a corner of your own psyche, blocked by obstacles you'll need to work out how to get past. The threat is never far off, and how you make it through isn't always up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/3cda28823fb750760de5587db24e4b8e.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/3cda28823fb750760de5587db24e4b8e.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/3cda28823fb750760de5587db24e4b8e.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight when you have no other choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some encounters put a weapon in your hand and demand you use it, managing scarce resources against grotesque manifestations of your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/ed08ccada2dcac21d3fbf211558a0e9e.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/ed08ccada2dcac21d3fbf211558a0e9e.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/ed08ccada2dcac21d3fbf211558a0e9e.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move fast and stay hidden when you don't</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some moments leave you unarmed, forced to move fast and quiet, ducking out of sight the instant something turns your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/fdb474ce5e668ed4c5e9441087633b9f.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/fdb474ce5e668ed4c5e9441087633b9f.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/fdb474ce5e668ed4c5e9441087633b9f.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Environments built for puzzles and pursuit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, grounded spaces where every obstacle in your way might also be hiding something worse. The deeper you're pulled, the less certain that ground becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/5321cf3830b8a8b9710445c6bbfc596f.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/5321cf3830b8a8b9710445c6bbfc596f.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/5321cf3830b8a8b9710445c6bbfc596f.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/c47bdf88fcec8a58773e08dfe3a0be52.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/c47bdf88fcec8a58773e08dfe3a0be52.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/c47bdf88fcec8a58773e08dfe3a0be52.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inner Demons is a first-person psychological horror game that takes you on a dark, surreal descent into your own unravelling mind. The monsters hunting you are physical manifestations of your fears, and nothing around you is guaranteed to be real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person psychological horror in the vein of Outlast and Resident Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mind you have to find your way through</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each section is a path through a corner of your own psyche, blocked by obstacles you'll need to work out how to get past. The threat is never far off, and how you make it through isn't always up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/3cda28823fb750760de5587db24e4b8e.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/3cda28823fb750760de5587db24e4b8e.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/3cda28823fb750760de5587db24e4b8e.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight when you have no other choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some encounters put a weapon in your hand and demand you use it, managing scarce resources against grotesque manifestations of your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/ed08ccada2dcac21d3fbf211558a0e9e.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/ed08ccada2dcac21d3fbf211558a0e9e.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/ed08ccada2dcac21d3fbf211558a0e9e.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Move fast and stay hidden when you don't</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some moments leave you unarmed, forced to move fast and quiet, ducking out of sight the instant something turns your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/fdb474ce5e668ed4c5e9441087633b9f.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/fdb474ce5e668ed4c5e9441087633b9f.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/fdb474ce5e668ed4c5e9441087633b9f.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Environments built for puzzles and pursuit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, grounded spaces where every obstacle in your way might also be hiding something worse. The deeper you're pulled, the less certain that ground becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/5321cf3830b8a8b9710445c6bbfc596f.poster.avif?t=1787732168\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/5321cf3830b8a8b9710445c6bbfc596f.webm?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/extras/5321cf3830b8a8b9710445c6bbfc596f.mp4?t=1787732168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Inner Demons is a first-person psychological horror game where the line between madness and reality dissolves. Explore, fight, and evade disturbing manifestations of your own mind as they invade the world around you - if you can tell them apart from what is real.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/cf20669b539dd4e4081ccced7bddc347f673da1f/header.jpg?t=1787732168", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/fadb8175634c3d9e181b4a071c6a766e55de4dd2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787732168", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4734860/fadb8175634c3d9e181b4a071c6a766e55de4dd2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787732168", "website": "https://inner-demons.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 8GB / AMD RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit (or Windows 10 64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12700K / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 4070 / AMD RX 7900 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 50 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible</li></u